Keep GLU out of libutil, which every EGL and Vulkan demo links.

readtex.c and showbuffer.c are the only members that include gl_wrap.h,
and gl_wrap.h includes <GL/glu.h>; readtex.c also calls gluBuild2DMipmaps.
Their callers are all in the GLUT and GLX trees. Leaving them in the
library makes a GLU-less system fail to compile eglinfo, es2gears and
vkgears over a header none of them use.

--- a/src/util/meson.build
+++ b/src/util/meson.build
@@ -22,8 +22,6 @@
 
 files_libutil = files(
   'glinfo_common.c',
-  'readtex.c',
-  'showbuffer.c',
   'trackball.c',
   'matrix.c',
 )
